<title>USA: St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul cattle trade $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared to Wednesday, slaughter steers and heifers $0.50 to 1.00 lower. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Choice 2-4 1100-1375 lbs 61.50-62.90.  Few Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1275 lbs 60.50-61.00. Few Select 2-3 1000-1200 lbs 59.00-60.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Few Choice 2-4 1080-1315 lbs 61.25-61.30.</p>
